(2186779, 298351, 34659, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  And they really do seem like an odd couple - like they have nothing to say to each other.  Well done.</td>', 'I really like this.  And they really do seem like an odd couple - like they have nothing to say to each other.  Well done.', '2006-02-27 10:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186780, 300783, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is really spectacular.  The more I study it, the better it gets.  Well done.  The color tones, the action, the lighting, the expressions.  Good job.</td>', 'This is really spectacular.  The more I study it, the better it gets.  Well done.  The color tones, the action, the lighting, the expressions.  Good job.', '2006-02-27 10:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186787, 300663, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, never been a fan of soft focus and this is no exception, I just don´t see what people like about this technique.  Just thought I´d give you a reason why I only gave this a 5.</td>', 'Sorry, never been a fan of soft focus and this is no exception, I just don´t see what people like about this technique.  Just thought I´d give you a reason why I only gave this a 5.', '2006-02-27 11:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186791, 300486, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh this is by FAR my favorite photo in this challenge!   It''s a WONDERFUL concept, and you have executed it to such perfection!  The dramatic sky could not be better.  The ocean "sky line" is beautiful.  And its wonderfully crisp and sharp.  This is a 10 with NO hesitation!!!</td>', 'Oh this is by FAR my favorite photo in this challenge!   It''s a WONDERFUL concept, and you have executed it to such perfection!  The dramatic sky could not be better.  The ocean "sky line" is beautiful.  And its wonderfully crisp and sharp.  This is a 10 with NO hesitation!!!', '2006-02-27 11:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186792, 300820, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh how CUTE!!!!!!!!!  They are both making the same face!  I LOVE this one!   Please give your little (and big) models a big smooch from me, okay?</td>', 'Oh how CUTE!!!!!!!!!  They are both making the same face!  I LOVE this one!   Please give your little (and big) models a big smooch from me, okay?', '2006-02-27 11:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186797, 300795, 24454, '<td valign="top">These photos always make me jealous because I want to do one like this so bad and am clueless how to do it!!  This one is executed to perfection!  I love everything about it:  the wonderful crystal blue night.  The perfect landscaping, and that wonderful old abandoned (but still beautiful) house!  I would honestly give you a 15 if I could. . .but you''ll just have to settle for a 10  :)</td>', 'These photos always make me jealous because I want to do one like this so bad and am clueless how to do it!!  This one is executed to perfection!  I love everything about it:  the wonderful crystal blue night.  The perfect landscaping, and that wonderful old abandoned (but still beautiful) house!  I would honestly give you a 15 if I could. . .but you''ll just have to settle for a 10  :)', '2006-02-27 11:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186798, 300623, 39560, '<td valign="top">In this day and age there is nothing odd about this.</td>', 'In this day and age there is nothing odd about this.', '2006-02-27 11:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186799, 300855, 24454, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed!  I find myself very immpressed that you could make a wrench and a push pin so appealing to me  :)  And yet you really have!</td>', 'Nicely executed!  I find myself very immpressed that you could make a wrench and a push pin so appealing to me  :)  And yet you really have!', '2006-02-27 11:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186802, 300680, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  So clean and crisp.  And a nice creative concept.  Great job!!!!!!</td>', 'Very well done!  So clean and crisp.  And a nice creative concept.  Great job!!!!!!', '2006-02-27 11:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186810, 300756, 6519, '<td valign="top">This is very .... umm.... basic?  But you truly have an odd couple here, which puts you in the top 10.</td>', 'This is very .... umm.... basic?  But you truly have an odd couple here, which puts you in the top 10.', '2006-02-27 11:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186811, 300741, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhhhhh. . . this is SO. . .so. ..wonderful!   Your kitty on the right looks very much like my Smudge.   And kudos to getting them to pose for you like that!  I love your background.  I love the way one is looking away and one at the camera.  It''s clean and sharp.  My only teeny tiny suggestion would have been to crop it a little more on the right just so those beautiful faces would have completely filled the frame.  But I LOVE this one anyway!!!  9</td>', 'Ohhhhhhhhh. . . this is SO. . .so. ..wonderful!   Your kitty on the right looks very much like my Smudge.   And kudos to getting them to pose for you like that!  I love your background.  I love the way one is looking away and one at the camera.  It''s clean and sharp.  My only teeny tiny suggestion would have been to crop it a little more on the right just so those beautiful faces would have completely filled the frame.  But I LOVE this one anyway!!!  9', '2006-02-27 11:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186813, 298836, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awesome concept, illustrated to perfection!!!!!</td>', 'Awesome concept, illustrated to perfection!!!!!', '2006-02-27 11:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186815, 300774, 6519, '<td valign="top">Go Woody! Run away with her, you CAN be happy!<br/>Nice idea, interesting angle and actually on topic, too. Well done!</td>', 'Go Woody! Run away with her, you CAN be happy!Nice idea, interesting angle and actually on topic, too. Well done!', '2006-02-27 11:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186817, 300724, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Way to go!!!!!!  What a creative concept and exeucted to beautiful perfection!!!!  Could not be improved on in my book!!  10</td>', 'Oh Way to go!!!!!!  What a creative concept and exeucted to beautiful perfection!!!!  Could not be improved on in my book!!  10', '2006-02-27 11:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186818, 300680, 6519, '<td valign="top">Marvellous take on the challenge! Nice, clear photo, too. I like it!</td>', 'Marvellous take on the challenge! Nice, clear photo, too. I like it!', '2006-02-27 11:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186820, 300739, 39560, '<td valign="top">The act you are trying to depict would be odd, other than that I don''t see what''s really odd about two geese. Other than that I like the photo.</td>', 'The act you are trying to depict would be odd, other than that I don''t see what''s really odd about two geese. Other than that I like the photo.', '2006-02-27 11:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2186821, 299737, 6519, '<td valign="top">The white balance is bugging me, but  other than that I love it!! Nice composition and background, great take on the challenge. Well done!</td>', 'The white balance is bugging me, but  other than that I love it!! Nice composition and background, great take on the challenge. Well done!', '2006-02-27 11:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
