(2186829, 300885, 6519, '<td valign="top">This is so clever.... it really says Felix and Oscar without even having any people in it. You have nailed the challenge 100%, plus you managed to sneak a colorful flower pic in. Love it! 9</td>', 'This is so clever.... it really says Felix and Oscar without even having any people in it. You have nailed the challenge 100%, plus you managed to sneak a colorful flower pic in. Love it! 9', '2006-02-27 11:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
