(2187186, 300648, 45790, '<td valign="top">I''d crop off everything from the shore upwards and just show the fishermen on the ice.</td>', 'I''d crop off everything from the shore upwards and just show the fishermen on the ice.', '2006-02-27 13:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187209, 300751, 7322, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...the title suggests opposites to me more than odd couple. Is there a distinction? Hard call. Without the title I wouldn''t get it. I like the colors of this photo. I''m not nuts about the  <br/>angle which makes it look like the candy is sliding toward the viewer.</td>', 'Hmmm...the title suggests opposites to me more than odd couple. Is there a distinction? Hard call. Without the title I wouldn''t get it. I like the colors of this photo. I''m not nuts about the  angle which makes it look like the candy is sliding toward the viewer.', '2006-02-27 13:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187214, 300064, 6132, '<td valign="top">Very nice - a cute image.</td>', 'Very nice - a cute image.', '2006-02-27 13:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187221, 300795, 6132, '<td valign="top">A brilliant and original idea for this challenge. For some reason I''m thinking Beetlejuice when I look at :)</td>', 'A brilliant and original idea for this challenge. For some reason I''m thinking Beetlejuice when I look at :)', '2006-02-27 13:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187223, 300853, 53853, '<td valign="top">very cool!  the two input outlet with a three prong plug...very clever!  that would be an odd couple indeed!</td>', 'very cool!  the two input outlet with a three prong plug...very clever!  that would be an odd couple indeed!', '2006-02-27 13:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187225, 300867, 7322, '<td valign="top">??? I''m looking and looking but I don''t understand the connection, or the title for that matter. A drug deal taking place? The women don''t look all that different from each other --they both have a kind of arty-hippie vibe. Are they a couple and that is what is meant to be odd? These days a gay couple isn''t an oddity to most people. I''m sorry, I''m just not getting it. <br/> <br/>In terms of the photograph, as a street photo it would work better for me if it were clearer what was taking place and if we could see more of their faces.</td>', '??? I''m looking and looking but I don''t understand the connection, or the title for that matter. A drug deal taking place? The women don''t look all that different from each other --they both have a kind of arty-hippie vibe. Are they a couple and that is what is meant to be odd? These days a gay couple isn''t an oddity to most people. I''m sorry, I''m just not getting it.  In terms of the photograph, as a street photo it would work better for me if it were clearer what was taking place and if we could see more of their faces.', '2006-02-27 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187231, 300751, 29474, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the relevance. Sweet and Tart as flavours? It''s a nice colourful picture though.</td>', 'I don''t get the relevance. Sweet and Tart as flavours? It''s a nice colourful picture though.', '2006-02-27 13:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187236, 300603, 6132, '<td valign="top">Excellent image! Are those rollarblades on the young sirs feet? Brave fellow :) Good composition, nice tones, good overall conversion to B/W, good job</td>', 'Excellent image! Are those rollarblades on the young sirs feet? Brave fellow :) Good composition, nice tones, good overall conversion to B/W, good job', '2006-02-27 13:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187240, 299952, 7322, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge with potential for good design. Unfortunately, this just isn''t an interesting photo to me. The light isn''t shown in a particularly compelling way. It has potential as interesting subject matter in the curves but this angle doesn''t exploit that. A central placement of the subject matter is generally not the best choice either. The light is competing with the busy background of the trees. If you had perhaps shown the lamp in contrast with a single tree this might have worked. I don''t think it was the best pairing to start with though.</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge with potential for good design. Unfortunately, this just isn''t an interesting photo to me. The light isn''t shown in a particularly compelling way. It has potential as interesting subject matter in the curves but this angle doesn''t exploit that. A central placement of the subject matter is generally not the best choice either. The light is competing with the busy background of the trees. If you had perhaps shown the lamp in contrast with a single tree this might have worked. I don''t think it was the best pairing to start with though.', '2006-02-27 13:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187247, 300147, 6132, '<td valign="top">Wonderful street shot, love the vivid pink amongst the moderate tones. Well captured :)</td>', 'Wonderful street shot, love the vivid pink amongst the moderate tones. Well captured :)', '2006-02-27 13:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187254, 300803, 6132, '<td valign="top">Image looks quite soft to my eyes, maybe a play with sharpening could have improved the image. Good luck with the challenge</td>', 'Image looks quite soft to my eyes, maybe a play with sharpening could have improved the image. Good luck with the challenge', '2006-02-27 13:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187260, 300627, 6132, '<td valign="top">Cute photo :) I would have maybe cropped out the curtain to the left as I don''t feel it adds anything to the image. Good luck</td>', 'Cute photo :) I would have maybe cropped out the curtain to the left as I don''t feel it adds anything to the image. Good luck', '2006-02-27 13:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187267, 300852, 43405, '<td valign="top">Really a good idea. Well done</td>', 'Really a good idea. Well done', '2006-02-27 14:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187273, 298812, 29474, '<td valign="top">The perfect couple ... have a hard time seeing the oddness. The colours are great although the flower overwhelms the bee.</td>', 'The perfect couple ... have a hard time seeing the oddness. The colours are great although the flower overwhelms the bee.', '2006-02-27 14:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187287, 300410, 43405, '<td valign="top">The reflections of the feet is what does it for me in this photograph. Bet on a top 5 finish at least. Pray do tell how this was set up. 10</td>', 'The reflections of the feet is what does it for me in this photograph. Bet on a top 5 finish at least. Pray do tell how this was set up. 10', '2006-02-27 14:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
