(2187365, 300879, 41522, '<td valign="top">An odd couple and a nice pose for the pair.  Tricky lighting by the looks of it.  The dark lighting makes it difficult to see the details of the Canada Goose.  Maybe some fill flash or a higher ISO might have helped.  JMO.</td>', 'An odd couple and a nice pose for the pair.  Tricky lighting by the looks of it.  The dark lighting makes it difficult to see the details of the Canada Goose.  Maybe some fill flash or a higher ISO might have helped.  JMO.', '2006-02-27 14:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187377, 299010, 41522, '<td valign="top">The size of this makes it difficult to rate.  You are allowed to go as big as 640 pixels on the long edge ... that will help us to see your image better.</td>', 'The size of this makes it difficult to rate.  You are allowed to go as big as 640 pixels on the long edge ... that will help us to see your image better.', '2006-02-27 14:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187389, 300199, 33947, '<td valign="top">Good concept for the challenge.</td>', 'Good concept for the challenge.', '2006-02-27 14:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187394, 300783, 41522, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo.  Good exposure and very nice focus and DOF.  I''m just having trouble with how this is an odd couple.  Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t see anything odd about this.  JMO</td>', 'A very nice photo.  Good exposure and very nice focus and DOF.  I''m just having trouble with how this is an odd couple.  Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t see anything odd about this.  JMO', '2006-02-27 14:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187397, 300462, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think your title is bang on here but, for me, there is nothing odd about kids acting crazy.  JMO.</td>', 'I think your title is bang on here but, for me, there is nothing odd about kids acting crazy.  JMO.', '2006-02-27 14:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
