(2187417, 300853, 6519, '<td valign="top">OH boy........ I''ll cross fingers for you with this one. My immediate reaction was: "Huh? Why odd couple? Perfect match, more like it!!!" Then I studied it some more and noticed the mismatch..... not easy to see. I do like it a lot, but perhaps you should have made it a bit more obvious.</td>', 'OH boy........ I''ll cross fingers for you with this one. My immediate reaction was: "Huh? Why odd couple? Perfect match, more like it!!!" Then I studied it some more and noticed the mismatch..... not easy to see. I do like it a lot, but perhaps you should have made it a bit more obvious.', '2006-02-27 15:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187418, 298812, 41522, '<td valign="top">A very nice macro shot, but Bees and Flowers go together.  Maybe I need to shift paradigms?</td>', 'A very nice macro shot, but Bees and Flowers go together.  Maybe I need to shift paradigms?', '2006-02-27 15:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
