(2187460, 300199, 6519, '<td valign="top">Hmm...  he is pulling her hands away - he doesn''t want to be part of this, so we don''t really have a "couple". You certainly managed to keep my attention with this one, I''ve been studying this for ages :-) <br/>I''m not fond of the crop on his face. I think it would have been better to show the whole face, or none of it. <br/>I like the colors of the skin tones against the black.</td>', 'Hmm...  he is pulling her hands away - he doesn''t want to be part of this, so we don''t really have a "couple". You certainly managed to keep my attention with this one, I''ve been studying this for ages :-) I''m not fond of the crop on his face. I think it would have been better to show the whole face, or none of it. I like the colors of the skin tones against the black.', '2006-02-27 15:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187461, 300741, 41522, '<td valign="top">Nice cat portrait with a good complimentary background.  Noth sure how this is an odd couple though.  Am I missing something?</td>', 'Nice cat portrait with a good complimentary background.  Noth sure how this is an odd couple though.  Am I missing something?', '2006-02-27 15:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
