(2187463, 300603, 41522, '<td valign="top">Yin &amp; Yang are a perfect couple.  This image is awesome with great tones and composition, but I''m having trouble gauging how it fits in the challenge?  JMO</td>', 'Yin & Yang are a perfect couple.  This image is awesome with great tones and composition, but I''m having trouble gauging how it fits in the challenge?  JMO', '2006-02-27 15:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
