(2187474, 300885, 41522, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Great lighting and an odd couple of the flowers makes this one of the better shots in this challenge.  Good work.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Great lighting and an odd couple of the flowers makes this one of the better shots in this challenge.  Good work.', '2006-02-27 15:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
