(2188956, 300751, 44611, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot; good colour, light and dof - but try as I might, I cannot get the connection to Odd Couple?  There doesn''t seem to be an odd couple at all, unless you count the two blue or two green sweets, neither of which are the main focus of the image.  Perhaps the connection is too subtle, or geographically/culturally limited?</td>', 'This is a good shot; good colour, light and dof - but try as I might, I cannot get the connection to Odd Couple?  There doesn''t seem to be an odd couple at all, unless you count the two blue or two green sweets, neither of which are the main focus of the image.  Perhaps the connection is too subtle, or geographically/culturally limited?', '2006-02-28 01:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
