(2196424, 300724, 36988, '<td valign="top">I hear time and again that a beautiful sunset is just that... a sunset, unless there''s a subject to focus on. You''ve captured this sunset beautifully and turned this into a powerful image with a great point of interest. You should be thrilled with your final result... I am... :)10</td>', 'I hear time and again that a beautiful sunset is just that... a sunset, unless there''s a subject to focus on. You''ve captured this sunset beautifully and turned this into a powerful image with a great point of interest. You should be thrilled with your final result... I am... :)10', '2006-03-02 17:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2196464, 300314, 36988, '<td valign="top">A nice capture... perhaps a bit of a stretch to meet the challenge but perhaps not. The commp is really good and you''ve got great tones... well done... :)</td>', 'A nice capture... perhaps a bit of a stretch to meet the challenge but perhaps not. The commp is really good and you''ve got great tones... well done... :)', '2006-03-02 17:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
