(2200390, 300664, 32872, '<td valign="top">These birds are certainly strange in appearance! I love their beaks.  This image would have worked so wonderfully in the duo-toned competition. :)<br/> <br/>I wish they were a little bit lighter, though.</td>', 'These birds are certainly strange in appearance! I love their beaks.  This image would have worked so wonderfully in the duo-toned competition. :) I wish they were a little bit lighter, though.', '2006-03-04 18:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
