(2200525, 300561, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Love the rich colors - great with background - cool perspective. Nicely done, hope it does well.</td>', 'Great shot! Love the rich colors - great with background - cool perspective. Nicely done, hope it does well.', '2006-03-04 19:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200527, 300574, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great picture!  Good job on metering and great perspective!</td>', 'Great picture!  Good job on metering and great perspective!', '2006-03-04 19:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200532, 300602, 47852, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is about this shot that makes me like it so much.  Maybe the depth of the lines?  The contrasting colors?  Lines?  Anyway, it''s a cool shot :)</td>', 'I don''t know what it is about this shot that makes me like it so much.  Maybe the depth of the lines?  The contrasting colors?  Lines?  Anyway, it''s a cool shot :)', '2006-03-04 20:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200534, 300603, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, wonderful capture!  Great DOF and perspective!  This one should do very well - congrats on a awesome image!  (Great title too!)</td>', 'Wow, wonderful capture!  Great DOF and perspective!  This one should do very well - congrats on a awesome image!  (Great title too!)', '2006-03-04 20:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200537, 300680, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great image!  Wonderful concept - nicely executed!</td>', 'Great image!  Wonderful concept - nicely executed!', '2006-03-04 20:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200539, 300759, 47852, '<td valign="top">Definately an odd flavor combination.  They even look strange together!  The colors seem a bit off... oversaturated maybe?  I''m not sure.</td>', 'Definately an odd flavor combination.  They even look strange together!  The colors seem a bit off... oversaturated maybe?  I''m not sure.', '2006-03-04 20:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200543, 300457, 47852, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like an egg, or at least the yolk of one.  Seems a bit fuzzy to me.</td>', 'This almost looks like an egg, or at least the yolk of one.  Seems a bit fuzzy to me.', '2006-03-04 20:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200549, 298954, 47852, '<td valign="top">Negotiated peace... but the look on the cats face is saying "I''m still watching you!"  This one needs rotated counterclockwise, but I can see where you''d end up cropping off part of the cat if you did that.</td>', 'Negotiated peace... but the look on the cats face is saying "I''m still watching you!"  This one needs rotated counterclockwise, but I can see where you''d end up cropping off part of the cat if you did that.', '2006-03-04 20:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200551, 300663, 47852, '<td valign="top">Definately odd and the composition is nice, but its just a bit too soft for me.</td>', 'Definately odd and the composition is nice, but its just a bit too soft for me.', '2006-03-04 20:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200553, 300820, 47852, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how you got these two to tilt their heads in the same way, but works by making them even odder!</td>', 'I have no idea how you got these two to tilt their heads in the same way, but works by making them even odder!', '2006-03-04 20:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200561, 300469, 47852, '<td valign="top">A well captured ''odd couple'' for the challenge.  I never really thought of pigs as cute, but these two have a kind of cuteness about them.  Nicely done.</td>', 'A well captured ''odd couple'' for the challenge.  I never really thought of pigs as cute, but these two have a kind of cuteness about them.  Nicely done.', '2006-03-04 20:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
