(2202401, 300623, 33400, '<td valign="top">Pretty bold shot, hope it does well.  I like the way this is lit, but would prefer to see Jill a little less exposed.  The image expresses an uncompromising attitude that seems a little more intent in Jack.  The dark between them is especially poignant.<br/>Good job.</td>', 'Pretty bold shot, hope it does well.  I like the way this is lit, but would prefer to see Jill a little less exposed.  The image expresses an uncompromising attitude that seems a little more intent in Jack.  The dark between them is especially poignant.Good job.', '2006-03-05 21:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
