(2202410, 299590, 33400, '<td valign="top">This took me a minute.  I thought I was seeing some new species smiling at me...  How many shots did you get to take? And did they complain about staying down so long?</td>', 'This took me a minute.  I thought I was seeing some new species smiling at me...  How many shots did you get to take? And did they complain about staying down so long?', '2006-03-05 21:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202411, 300783, 33400, '<td valign="top">Great balance and a very crisp, clean image.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great balance and a very crisp, clean image.  Nicely done.', '2006-03-05 21:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202430, 300603, 23053, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the best in the challenge.  I''m a big fan of the gritty black &amp; white look, and this has it.  This shot, whether found or set-up, has built-in odd coupleability - different directions, different levels, different clothing, different sexes.  They are still similar enough to be considered a couple, though, so all is not lost.  The only note I would have is probably a hold-over from thinking about the Square Crop challenge - that being that the top of the shot could probably have gone without being missed.  Good luck.</td>', 'I think this is one of the best in the challenge.  I''m a big fan of the gritty black & white look, and this has it.  This shot, whether found or set-up, has built-in odd coupleability - different directions, different levels, different clothing, different sexes.  They are still similar enough to be considered a couple, though, so all is not lost.  The only note I would have is probably a hold-over from thinking about the Square Crop challenge - that being that the top of the shot could probably have gone without being missed.  Good luck.', '2006-03-05 22:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202436, 300561, 23053, '<td valign="top">A stong contender for the top prize...a shot that is simply easy to understand.  The color is, of course, the crux of your shot, and I think that you''ve done admirably.  Good idea and good luck.</td>', 'A stong contender for the top prize...a shot that is simply easy to understand.  The color is, of course, the crux of your shot, and I think that you''ve done admirably.  Good idea and good luck.', '2006-03-05 22:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202439, 298836, 23053, '<td valign="top">Wonderful concept and well executed.  I tried something in this vien in the Shoes challenge, but achieved nothing near as lyrical and sublime as this.  I can say that I feel the boot is almost too dark, and that some of the detail is lost.  I don''t think that that is overpowering, however.  Good luck.</td>', 'Wonderful concept and well executed.  I tried something in this vien in the Shoes challenge, but achieved nothing near as lyrical and sublime as this.  I can say that I feel the boot is almost too dark, and that some of the detail is lost.  I don''t think that that is overpowering, however.  Good luck.', '2006-03-05 22:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202441, 300783, 23053, '<td valign="top">Beautifully seen and captured.  The exposure is just right, in my eyes.  This shot may not the most on-topic in the challenge, but regardless, it is  outstanding.  Good luck.</td>', 'Beautifully seen and captured.  The exposure is just right, in my eyes.  This shot may not the most on-topic in the challenge, but regardless, it is  outstanding.  Good luck.', '2006-03-05 22:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202455, 300147, 23053, '<td valign="top">I feel that this shot will do well.  I''m not a big fan of the D&amp;B work, but it does provide a gritty, urban feel that I assume was your intent, so for achieving your mind''s vision, well done.  Nevertheless, you''ve done a good job capturing this shot, which has inherent humor, and you must have a good eye to have caught it.  Good luck.</td>', 'I feel that this shot will do well.  I''m not a big fan of the D&B work, but it does provide a gritty, urban feel that I assume was your intent, so for achieving your mind''s vision, well done.  Nevertheless, you''ve done a good job capturing this shot, which has inherent humor, and you must have a good eye to have caught it.  Good luck.', '2006-03-05 22:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
