(2204069, 300199, 28710, '<td valign="top">Hilarious shot.<br/> <br/>I love that ring on her finger.<br/> <br/>I find this amusing because I was actually just speaking with someone this evening who just finished school at a private catholic school in Belize. She told me that many of the nuns got pregnant in the 7 years she was at the school. And seeing as there was only one man on campus, they all suspected it was the "father".<br/> <br/>In the words of Lucien Vinet, former catholic priest, paraphrased, "It''s neither natural nor scriptural to require abstinence and such naturally leads to a search for other outlets."<br/> <br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'Hilarious shot. I love that ring on her finger. I find this amusing because I was actually just speaking with someone this evening who just finished school at a private catholic school in Belize. She told me that many of the nuns got pregnant in the 7 years she was at the school. And seeing as there was only one man on campus, they all suspected it was the "father". In the words of Lucien Vinet, former catholic priest, paraphrased, "It''s neither natural nor scriptural to require abstinence and such naturally leads to a search for other outlets." Nicely done.', '2006-03-06 10:23:05.000000', NULL, 0),
