(2204366, 300623, 2333, '<td valign="top">Wow Rudy, I can''t believe you have not ribboned before! This is is so well deserved. You really nailed this the concept and execution are great.</td>', 'Wow Rudy, I can''t believe you have not ribboned before! This is is so well deserved. You really nailed this the concept and execution are great.', '2006-03-06 12:47:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2204396, 300774, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by larryslights:</b></div><hr/><i> You was robbed!  Robbed I tell ya!  Only 19th? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Probably because larry slighted me? jejeje Actually, there''s an obvious prejudice against Woodies and Duckies in DPC; rarely do they break into the winning ranks any longer. I guess they got overused... And when you combine a Woody with a Duckie in the same picture, you''re pretty well doomed. <br/> <br/>I''m happy with my top-20 on this one; it IS an "outcast" after all :-)<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'Originally posted by larryslights: You was robbed!  Robbed I tell ya!  Only 19th?   Probably because larry slighted me? jejeje Actually, there''s an obvious prejudice against Woodies and Duckies in DPC; rarely do they break into the winning ranks any longer. I guess they got overused... And when you combine a Woody with a Duckie in the same picture, you''re pretty well doomed.  I''m happy with my top-20 on this one; it IS an "outcast" after all :-) R.', '2006-03-06 13:06:22.000000', NULL, 0),
