(2204469, 300853, 26045, '<td valign="top"><br/>I really like this! It''s obviously well done, regardless of the challenge. I guess what would''ve made it more obvious to those seeking to fulfill the "odd couple" idea would have been to show a touch more of the outlet......at first glance, it isn''t totally visible that it''s a 2-prong, and only via the challenge theme did i take a closer look. maybe you could''ve chosen a more helpful title? hahaha, no no, that''s lame. it''s a good photo, be proud :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I really like this! It''s obviously well done, regardless of the challenge. I guess what would''ve made it more obvious to those seeking to fulfill the "odd couple" idea would have been to show a touch more of the outlet......at first glance, it isn''t totally visible that it''s a 2-prong, and only via the challenge theme did i take a closer look. maybe you could''ve chosen a more helpful title? hahaha, no no, that''s lame. it''s a good photo, be proud :) ', '2006-03-06 13:21:21.000000', NULL, 0),
