(2236938, 300029, 16648, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kenskid:</b></div><hr/><i> Why is this a DQ? I see many shots that use a montitor and/or "screen" as a background with the "subject" placed in front.<br/> <br/>KenSkid </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>read where he got the BG from - on the other shots like this it the entrant took the shot - in this case the ''artwork'' being literally represented IS the background.<br/> <br/>sorry to see a dq for someone honest to admit the source of the BG image.</td>', 'Originally posted by kenskid: Why is this a DQ? I see many shots that use a montitor and/or "screen" as a background with the "subject" placed in front. KenSkid   read where he got the BG from - on the other shots like this it the entrant took the shot - in this case the ''artwork'' being literally represented IS the background. sorry to see a dq for someone honest to admit the source of the BG image.', '2006-03-18 00:38:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2237345, 300029, 39057, '<td valign="top">OIC now...<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Prof_Fate:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kenskid:</b></div><hr/><i> Why is this a DQ? I see many shots that use a montitor and/or "screen" as a background with the "subject" placed in front.<br/> <br/>KenSkid </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>read where he got the BG from - on the other shots like this it the entrant took the shot - in this case the ''artwork'' being literally represented IS the background.<br/> <br/>sorry to see a dq for someone honest to admit the source of the BG image. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'OIC now... Originally posted by Prof_Fate: Originally posted by kenskid: Why is this a DQ? I see many shots that use a montitor and/or "screen" as a background with the "subject" placed in front. KenSkid   read where he got the BG from - on the other shots like this it the entrant took the shot - in this case the ''artwork'' being literally represented IS the background. sorry to see a dq for someone honest to admit the source of the BG image. ', '2006-03-18 10:45:17.000000', NULL, 0),
